        <content type="html"><![CDATA[<img src="https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/2737650?v=4" width="64" height="64" alt=""/><br/><h4 dir="auto">Summary</h4>
<p dir="auto">I was wondering why the compat data mentioned it no longer being supported since 18.5, and I found a reported webkit bug which mentions specifically that version. I'm not sure entirely sure</p>
